Apache is the web

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:43.419
server layer, so Apache software

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:45.099
that you install on your Linux

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:47.379
operating system onto the server

00:02:47.380 --> 00:02:49.209
