And then the next piece,

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:09.789
that's our M,

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.859
L M and

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:13.286
are M is for MySQL.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.289
MySQL is a free, open

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:19.999
source, SQL Structured Query

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:21.439
Language Database.

