Again, free, open source

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:24.799
community developed, community

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:26.689
supported so anybody can go

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:28.789
down, install it or download

00:03:28.790 --> 00:03:30.739
it, compile it, install it and run

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:32.779
it. And the idea behind

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:34.609
MySQL is it is

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:36.499
the database layer for your

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:38.179
LAMP stack. It's the database for

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:39.499
your website. Well, what is the

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:40.459
database?

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:42.199
A database has tables in it.

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:43.429
Inside the tables.

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:45.169
We store data.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:46.759
And so if you think about going to a

00:03:46.760 --> 00:03:48.859
website where you're going to log

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:50.689
in, right, that website

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:52.399
prompts you for credentials.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:53.389
What's your username and your

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:54.589
password?

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:56.629
Before you could log into

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:57.689
it, you had to register for it.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:03:59.179
You had to give it your name, your

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:00.829
address, your telephone number, your

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:02.779
email address, so on and so forth.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.819
All of that data that you input

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:06.349
goes into this database.

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:08.299
And so when you log in, it's going

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:09.379
to go and it's going to check

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:11.029
against the database to say, Hey,

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:12.229
does this user name match?

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.909
Does this password match?

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.349
So that's the database.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.449
That's where all of the data that

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:20.028
is dynamic is housed.

00:04:20.029 --> 00:04:22.279
And then our fourth, are P,

